## Goals

- Capture diagnostic signals from multiple runtime sources.
- Normalise platform-specific events into a common model.
- Filter unrelated diagnostic noise.
- Correlate signals with user actions and execution traces.
- Rank signals deterministically.
- Provide stable diagnostic results across platforms.

---

## Non-Goals

This specification does not:

- Replace platform logging systems.
- Perform root-cause analysis.
- Inspect debugger memory.
- Modify application logging.
- Introduce custom instrumentation into applications.

